<title>POLAND: Debica surges on strong Jan earnings.</title>
<headline>Debica surges on strong Jan earnings.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish tyre maker TC Debica SA surged the maximum 10 percent in active trade to 93.5 zlotys after the firm published strong January earnings on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;The stock had to go up that much after such a result,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>Debica lifted January earnings to 6.8 million zlotys from 2.1 zlotys a year ago, with sales rising to 54 million from 41 million zlotys. Preliminary figures show the firm netting 36.4 million zlotys over all of last year on 605.9 million in sales.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
